-#
  DEL-09, BR-23: for how many months calls are kept, and from which day on a
  call cannot be deleted. The administrator sets the period; a supervisor
  reads it.
%section.setting-card{ aria: { labelledby: "calls-kept-title" } }
  %h2#calls-kept-title How long calls are kept
  %p
    Calls are kept for #{tag.strong("#{setting.call_months} months")}: a call received on
    #{tag.strong(l(setting.calls_kept_from))} or later cannot be deleted.
  - if policy(:setting).update?
    = form_with url: call_retention_path, method: :patch, class: "form" do |form|
      .field
        = form.label :months, "Keep calls for"
        .field-unit
          = form.number_field :months, value: setting.call_months, min: Setting::MONTHS.min, required: true,
            class: "short", aria: { describedby: "months-hint" }
          %span months
        %span.hint#months-hint
          Not less than #{Setting::MONTHS.min} months. Nothing is deleted by itself: the period only allows a deletion
          by hand, here or on a call's page.
      %div
        = form.submit "Save", class: "button"
  - else
    %p.note The period is set by the administrator.
